{"id":"7f79a5e6c719ebee","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property.md","title":"ZFC Perfect Set Property","display":"df-zfc-perfect-set-property — ZFC Perfect Set Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property"],"display":"df-zfc-perfect-set-property — ZFC Perfect Set Property","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-perfect-set-property — ZFC Perfect Set Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\)</span> (Polish-space predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectSetProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectSetProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectSetProperty}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n\\left(\n|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\lor\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\n\\left[\nP\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x)\\right)\n\\right]\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectSetProperty}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n\\left(\n|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\lor\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\n\\left[\nP\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x)\\right)\n\\right]\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology is an explicit argument; the perfect-subset witness expands\nnonemptiness, closedness, and absence of isolated points.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polish}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectSetProperty}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PerfectSetProperty}_S(\\Gamma,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n\\left(\n|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\lor\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\n\\left[\nP\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land X\\setminus P\\in\\tau\n\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left(x\\in U\\to\\exists y\\in P\\cap U\\;(y\\neq x)\\right)\n\\right]\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1217,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3096","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property.md|58-df-zfc-perfect-set-property]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2be08d4ee8aa1590","4b3a8629f6a6f868"]}